## Prerequisites

| Requirement | Details |
|---|---|
| Terraform | `>= 1.5.0` |
| OCI provider | `>= 6.0.0` |
| OCI region | `{{ oci_region or '<oci-region>' }}` |
| Primary VM Cluster VCN | OCID stored in `var.primary_vcn_id` |
| Standby VM Cluster VCN | OCID stored in `var.standby_vcn_id` |
| OCI authentication | `~/.oci/config` or `TF_VAR_*` environment variables |

Both VM Clusters must already exist in the same OCI region before applying this configuration.

